<Legal title="Try it free: terms" h1="Terms for trying Arcus free" description="The terms for trying Arcus free: what we access, what you get, and what we never do with it." path="/free-report-terms">
  <ul>
    <li>Trying Arcus is free. No card, no contract, no obligation to buy anything.</li>
    <li>We only use what you share to answer your question.</li>
    <li>You keep the slides and can share them with anyone.</li>
    <li>We never publish your answer, name or numbers. If we ever want to show it anonymized as an example, we’ll ask first, in writing, and you can say no.</li>
    <li>You approve exactly what we can access before we connect anything.</li>
  </ul>
</Legal>
